{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51719","headline":"咏大慈寺斋头鲜于闍梨 · 陈裕","name":"咏大慈寺斋头鲜于闍梨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒肉终朝没阙时，高堂大舍养肥屍。\n行婆满院多爲妇，童子成行半是儿。\n面折掇斋穷措大，笑迎搽粉阿尼师。\n一朝若也无常至，剑树刀山不放伊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}